WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.360
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:13.700
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.330
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.830
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.420
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.050
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.310
by ridding you...

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.480
...of your other love?

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.060
At sunset,

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.570
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.490
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.410
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.490
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.290
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:21.350
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.850
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:33.050 --> 00:01:37.720
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:40.490
Sagami Rei-kun. He's my chauffeur
and manager,

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:42.060
and used to be my boyfriend.

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:46.400
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy
and good friend.

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:48.740
The white bat without
a care in the world, Babbit!

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:50.740
Nope! Not a single care!

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:52.370
Mama, the Aoki Prize-winning writer.

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:55.750
Her essay, "My Daughter and I,"
goes on sale today.

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:08.470
It's coming... the day of our promise...

00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:14.330
Once the book comes out, what is
going to happen to Mama and me?

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:20.640
What is Mama planning to do with me?

00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:31.220
"Ah, What a Surprise! Mama's Book"

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:47.060
If you feel like crying, come find me.

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:51.810
The words that Hayama said back then...
are giving me support now.

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:56.510
There's a place where I can go to cry.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:01.110
Sana-chan, whenever you're ready,
let's go.

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:07.080
They said that Sana-chan
will be coming out this way!

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.750
--No, Sana-chan is coming from this direction!
--Sana-chan is incredibly popular, huh?

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:13.750
--Sana-chan really is coming from here!
--Huh, Akito-kun? Did you hear me?

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:16.090
Akito-kun! Hello!?

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:17.760
Akito-kun...?

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:21.760
Please make way! Pardon me!
Please let us through!

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:23.430
Please let us through!

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:26.100
Please don't push, it's dangerous!

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:28.100
Please don't pull me!

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:30.440
Yaah! Please don't bite me!

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:31.540
--Thank you very much!
--Sana-chan, I watch you all the time!

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:32.700
--Hang in there!
--I'm hanging in there!

00:03:32.710 --> 00:03:33.870
--Thank you very much!
--We'll keep cheering for you!

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:35.370
--Thank you so very much!
--Here, take this rice that I picked
for you out in the country!

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:36.850
Thanks.

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:42.050
Thank you, thank you, everyone.
Thanks for your support.

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:43.380
Sana-chan, help!

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:45.050
Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:47.720
Ee-yow-ow-ow-ow-ow...!
Sana-chan, stop, stop!

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:48.720
Oh, sorry!

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:50.690
That's dangerous!
Be careful not to do this!

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:52.670
This has been the white bat, Babbit.

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:59.060
Amazing, Sana-chan. You sure
are popular. I'm taken aback.

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:01.400
Tsuyoshi-kun, your nose is bleeding.

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:03.740
That's because you
just squished your nose.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:04.740
Here, have a tissue!

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:06.410
Sana-chan, I can't breathe!

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:08.740
Breathe through your mouth!

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:10.740
Sana-chan! One picture, please!

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:13.750
What should I do? He looks like
a cameraman from a magazine.

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:15.410
Sure, Rei-kun.

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:16.750
Sana-chan, you're so cute!

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:18.420
Okay, I'm taking it!

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:20.090
Ah! What are you doing!?

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:21.750
Huh!? Hayama is taking karate!?

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:22.750
Really?

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:27.260
Mm-hmm. Principal Narunaru said
that Hayama had a strong chop,

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:30.100
and that he should try it out.
So then Akito-kun said...

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:31.100
"I'll do it."

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:33.670
He really surprised me. I mean,

00:04:33.670 --> 00:04:36.550
Akito-kun doesn't have that kind of
forward-looking personality, you know?

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:39.370
That's so unlike him!

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:43.710
That perverse Hayama doing karate?
Someone that warped...?

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:45.380
Come to think of it...

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.050
Good day.

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:52.720
That's scary...!

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:54.720
Ah, speaking of Akito-kun...

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:56.390
Hayama!

00:04:57.390 --> 00:04:58.720
--Yo!
--Akito-kun!

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:01.760
I just had my picture taken
by a real cameraman!

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.730
It might appear in a
magazine or something!

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:05.730
With that face?

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:07.610
Want to have a look at your face?

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:09.730
Oh, no!

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:11.070
What a shame!

00:05:11.070 --> 00:05:15.070
--Hey, Hayama, I'll give you
a lift home. Hop in!
--Nosebleed! Nosebleed! Nosebleed!

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:19.020
Well, go ahead, go ahead, Hayama-chan,
get in, get in, please!

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:23.060
Then you won't be a
good match for Sana-chan.

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:26.190
I'm good.

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:30.230
Hayama...

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:37.030
Tomorrow... tomorrow,
Mama's essay is coming out.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:47.040
Well then, if anything happens...

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:49.520
...why don't you have Kamura comfort you?

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:54.050
What are you bringing up
Naozumi-kun here for!?

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:58.380
Aha! Hey... hey... hey...
hey... hey... hey...

00:05:58.380 --> 00:05:59.380
Are you jealous?

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:02.050
Don't be so full of yourself, you idiot!

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:03.050
Idiot?

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:04.060
Idiot!?

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:05.390
Did you call me an idiot!?

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:08.060
Hey, what is this!? Hayama, you liar!

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:09.730
Empty-promiser! Faker!
Who cares about you!?

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:12.730
Rei-kun! Let's go! Hey! Go home!

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:16.300
Ugh... Everyone is going to laugh at me
when my nosebleed tissue picture

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.070
gets printed in a magazine.
What will I do?

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:22.410
Is that still bugging you?
You're going to turn into a bug!

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:24.080
Ooh, I wish I hadn't said that.

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:28.080
What-- what exactly is...?
Rei-kun doesn't get this at all.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:30.420
Rei-kun, you just never mind.

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:32.190
Oh well, let's go home.

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:38.020
Okay, okay, closing up here...

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:40.690
She was amazing, Sensei!

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:42.460
It was as if the god of acting

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:45.030
had taken possession of Sana-chan
up on the stage, there!

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:46.370
I see.

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:50.670
She was sublime and valiant!
So pretty and charming, like a goddess!

00:06:50.670 --> 00:06:53.710
She looked like a brilliant
queen of the stage!

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:55.190
Oh, yeah?

00:06:57.710 --> 00:07:01.050
Sensei, it's too bad you
couldn't be there to see her.

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:03.580
I had a scheduling meeting
with my editor, Onda,

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:06.050
and I had some other messes
to take care of...

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:08.560
I'll come see you next time, Sana.

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:10.390
Okay.

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:13.730
Just to be safe, stay home
from school tomorrow.

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:14.060
Right.

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:16.290
It's all right!
No matter what may happen,

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:19.060
I will risk my own life
to protect Sana-chan!

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:21.300
It's finally the day when your book
is going on sale, Sensei.

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:25.740
Has your copy of the book arrived yet?
I'd like to read it right away.

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:28.410
They always send me the book
after the day it goes on sale.

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:29.940
Thanks for dinner.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.680
The publishing date is tomorrow.

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:38.080
This has been the white bat, Babbit,
coming to you from the Kurata household,

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:39.060
where tensions are running high.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:47.360
Tomorrow... tomorrow,
Mama's essay is coming out.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:51.070
So, how was Sana-chan? Was she cute?
Are you sweet on her again?

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:01.810
This has been the white bat, Babbit,
coming to you from the Hayama household,

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:03.710
which is enveloped in mystery.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:04.650
Just then...

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:11.720
What shall we do?

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:13.720
Hmm. I've been cooped up
in the house lately,

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:16.050
and haven't gotten much exercise,
so this is perfect.

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:16.720
Right?

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:17.720
Yep!

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:19.060
--Scatter!
--All right!

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:21.000
"Who is this person?"

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:23.900
Your hair is as strange as ever, huh?

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:28.070
You're so pretty when you wear it normally.
You'd have more men calling on you.

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:29.400
That's why I do this.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.670
Sana-chan, you're becoming
more and more beautiful, too.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:34.010
How about marrying your uncle here
when you're a little bigger?

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:35.010
Nope.

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:38.010
Hmph, what a rude man!

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:39.340
Who on earth is he?

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:41.350
The Sensei's ex-husband.

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:45.020
So, he's the one she
divorced when she was twenty?

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:46.690
Then, what is he doing here now?

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:50.360
Lend me some money. I'll pay
you back double-- no, triple.

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:53.360
Looks like you still can't
kick your gambling habit, huh?

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:55.030
Uncle, what would you
like to eat right now?

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:57.700
Huh? Let's see, eel over rice,
with a side of eel-liver soup.

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:59.030
Where would you like to go?

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:01.370
The gambling hall of fame,
Las Vegas, of course!

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:03.030
What type of woman do you like?

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:04.370
The rich kind!

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:09.040
Okay, there we are! "Same old
gold-digging man as ever, 100 percent."

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:10.710
Come on! Lend me some money.

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:12.980
Sana-chan, you have a
lot of money saved, right?

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:16.050
Just lend your uncle a little bit.
I'll make you even more.

00:09:16.050 --> 00:09:17.380
Nope!

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:20.390
You live in a mansion like this;
Misako-san, your books are selling,

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:23.390
and Sana-chan, your commercials
come on one after another,

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:25.720
so you can afford to let me
have a little bit, can't you?

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:28.570
I can't take any more! Switch on!

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:31.400
What? What's this?

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:32.830
As far as money goes, I'm stinking rich,

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:35.840
but I don't have a
single penny to give to you!

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:39.600
What fun! Mama, that useless sofa
which runs by remote control

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:42.340
that you bought mail order
for ¥175,000 did have a use, huh?

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:43.340
This isn't working right.

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:44.980
Mama, isn't it this one?

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:50.010
Wow, it's running, it's running!

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:51.350
--After him!
--You bet!

00:09:51.350 --> 00:09:52.480
Why are you so stingy?

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:55.020
I'm the one you used as a model for
the novel you won the Aoki Prize for!

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:56.690
Yes, yes, it's all thanks to you.

00:09:56.690 --> 00:10:00.020
Right, here is her Aoki
Prize-winning novel, "The Pimp and I."

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:01.360
--The pimp...
--Me.

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:04.670
Hold it!

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:11.040
Is that the bungee jump set?

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.700
The one that cost ¥30,000, huh?

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:15.040
And now, for the final trap, Shimura!

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:16.350
Right, Sensei.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:20.080
If I can't have any money,
can I take the vase in the living room,

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:21.380
or the scroll hanging in the alcove?

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:23.590
Are you still at it,
you good-for-nothing?

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:28.720
See you later, Uncle!

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:30.720
Come back anytime!

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:31.390
Salt!

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:32.330
Right.

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:38.860
I think you would have been better off
not letting him into the house at all

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:40.670
if you're going to
chase him away like this.

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:44.470
Whenever I see that man, I'm struck
by how foolish I was in my youth,

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:46.340
and it lets me be immature again.

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:50.010
Uncle is beyond help, but somehow,
you just can't hate him, huh?

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:54.010
♪ He's beyond help,
but you just can't hate him! ♪

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:56.010
--♪ You can't hate him,
but you can't help him! ♪
--♪ No matter how many times ♪

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:58.020
--♪ When you don't have ginger,
use grated garlic. ♪
--♪ we give him a hard time, ♪

00:10:58.020 --> 00:11:00.020
--♪ I sure would like some
garlic fried chicken! ♪
--♪ he always comes back, ♪

00:11:00.020 --> 00:11:02.350
--♪ Garlicky-licky-licky whoo! ♪
--♪ once he forgets. ♪

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:04.020
Well, the evening wind
is bad for the body,

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:06.360
--so let's get to bed right away.
--Right!

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:09.030
I better not let
those two turn against me.

00:11:09.030 --> 00:11:11.030
This week's Sana-chan.

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:14.030
Mother is in there, too!

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:18.700
Tomorrow... tomorrow is almost here...

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:22.880
So if you feel like crying,
come find me.

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:28.420
Should I press it...?

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:33.590
If anything happens, why don't
you have Kamura comfort you?

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:52.880
By pushing this, I can reach Hayama...
Yeah, all I have to do is push...

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:04.200
Should I push it? Should I? Should I?

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:14.170
Good morning. For our
first topic this morning,

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:15.580
I'd like to present some of
the slightly shocking content...

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:20.260
...from the essay by Kurata Misako-san,
which just went on sale today.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:23.590
According to this book,
Kurata Misako-san's only daughter,

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:25.760
Kurata Sana-san, who is currently
appearing in several commercials,

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:26.600
among other things,

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:30.600
was an abandoned child that she found
on a park bench eleven years ago,

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:31.600
and the details--

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:32.890
Sensei!

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:35.560
What is this!? Is this true!?

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:38.570
Typically, when it is called
an essay, it is true, right?

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:39.530
You mean...?

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.530
There was a whole pile of books
delivered to me over there,

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:44.110
so if you're going to form any opinions,
do so after you read it.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.870
This sure comes as a surprise, huh?

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:51.910
If this is the truth, then to write
about it like this after all this time...

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:54.920
Sana-chan is still in
elementary school, and all...

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:57.210
You have to wonder what state of mind
this was written in.

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:58.880
I would certainly like to
ask that of the Sensei herself.

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:01.260
Kurata Misako-san is a rational author
who is awfully famous--

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:04.590
Sensei, what about Sana-chan's...
What about Sana-chan's feelings...?

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:06.890
It's okay, Rei-kun.

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.470
It's okay.

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:12.770
This is what we promised.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:18.900
"Among ordinary mothers
and their children,

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:20.940
they can apparently joke
about things like this,

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.570
telling them 'you were a child
I found somewhere',

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:27.910
but for me and my daughter,
it was the truth, so it was no joke.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:32.910
I have never once thought of coming
across my daughter as an abandoned child

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:34.870
to be misfortunate in and of itself.

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:37.880
--Rather, I think of it as a
fortunate encounter."
--Kurata-san! Please come talk to us!

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:40.380
Kurata-san! Please give us a statement!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:43.550
Oh, they're here, all right.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:45.880
Must be a slow day for everyone.

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:47.550
--"As I entered my third year
--Ah, that's the reporter

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:48.970
--of marriage at 20,
--from "4 o' Clock Housewife."

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:51.890
--I learned that it would be difficult
for me to have children.
--We need to repaint the estate gate soon.

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:55.230
--That gave me a great
inferiority complex.
--The plants also need to be pruned.

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:58.650
Of course, there were other reasons
for my divorce.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:01.270
I wrote about those in 'The Pimp and I,'

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:04.780
for which I received the Aoki Prize,
so if anyone is interested,

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:07.910
I'd like for them to read
'The Pimp and I.'"

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:11.080
Aw, it wasn't printed. Huh...?

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:14.580
Ah! Those are my fingers!

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:16.160
And you're happy to see them?

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:18.580
Never mind that, something terrible
is going on! Buy this!

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:19.580
"Zenjiro's room"
Good morning!

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:20.580
Yes?

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:23.590
Please, could you give us a statement?

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:25.920
What is this, what is this!?
I haven't done nothing!

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:29.390
Nishimura Tomie-chan and I just
danced a little at that disco.

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:30.930
She watches "Child's Toy."

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:34.180
Did you know about the actions her mother
would be taking at this time?

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:36.850
Her mothuh? Her mothuh's
got nothing to do with it.

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:39.850
Don't you think she will be
deeply scarred by this incident?

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:42.520
Scarred? You're not tawlking about
that thing with the stewardess, right?

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:43.360
How do you know about that?

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:44.570
--Anyhow, we've already broken up.
--We asked Zenjiro-san,

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:46.860
--I even cried over it.
--who plays Kurata Sana-chan's teacher
on "Child's Toy," about all this.

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:47.860
Right, Sana-chan...

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:51.990
S- Sana-chan!? Why didn't
you say so soonuh!?

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.200
Akito-kun! Have you read this?

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:59.210
"I only had a five percent chance
of having a child.

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:03.210
Once the doctor told me, I was
despondent over that number.

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:08.220
Now, I hold out hope in that
five percent, but I was young.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:12.470
I thought that I could no longer
go on living as an ordinary woman,

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:14.220
and in my distress,

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:17.980
I came to the conclusion that if I could
not go on living as an ordinary woman,

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:21.060
then I would go on living
as a strange woman?

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:24.230
Fix me up!

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:26.230
Are you sure you want to go with this?

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:27.900
Mm-hmm, okay.

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:30.950
"I started by making my hairstyle
as strange as I could,

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:32.530
and then walking around town.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:35.870
Naturally, the other people an the street
looked upon me with a strange eye.

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:38.500
--My body felt lighter,
and before I realized it,
--What was I so worried about?

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:44.040
my feet were skipping all on their own.
Just then, I heard a baby crying."

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:48.800
"I went into the park, as if I
was being drawn in by her voice."

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:54.220
"It was a baby who had just been born.

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:57.220
That was Sana.

00:15:57.220 --> 00:16:00.730
After the baby had been
in the hospital for a week,

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:02.560
she was turned over to a nursing home.

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:06.730
I went to go see how she was, every day.

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:08.900
--I had the TV and newspapers
appeal to the mother
--Say, can we go over to Sana-chan's place?

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:11.240
--who had abandoned her child,
--What would you do when we got there?
You won't be able to see her.

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:13.240
--but that had no effect.
--We've got time, don't we?

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:15.820
After a month,
I officially took her in,

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:18.910
despite the opposition
of those around me.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:21.580
It was something that I had
secretly made up my mind

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:23.920
to do when I first found her.

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:28.250
The day my daughter turned 5,
I told her everything."

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:31.670
Sana, Mama is about
to tell you some things,

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:33.510
but you only need to understand
as much of it as you can, okay?

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:34.840
Okay.

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:37.600
Mama didn't give birth to you.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:41.850
So, you see, Mama wants very much
to meet your real mother.

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:45.850
Now, she may not be around
anywhere anymore, but even so...

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:47.860
you'd like to meet her too, right?

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:54.150
Sana, you will join Gekidan Komawari.

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:56.530
Mama was also in it for a little while
when she was little.

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:58.830
You don't need to become a star,

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:01.500
but at least become a little
more famous than other children.

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:04.080
Mama will also become famous,
through her novels.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:07.880
Then, the two of us will try
to call out to your real mother.

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:10.960
It may be a bit of a
drawn-out battle, though.

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:14.880
Is that okay, Sana? Promise me?

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.590
Yes, Mama.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:22.430
"6th Year, 3rd Class"

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:23.890
Say, this says...

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:26.900
Her mother isn't her real mother.

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:30.230
Come to mention it,
they don't look at all alike.

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:31.230
--Yes...?

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:33.280
I didn't say anything.

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:40.700
Akito-kun...

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:49.670
A-chan, about your Mama...
I love you, A-chan,

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:51.550
and that's why I tried
so hard to have you.

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:56.550
And so, for Mama's sake, keep at it,
and go on living, okay, A-chan?

00:17:57.880 --> 00:18:01.350
I wonder how she must have
felt when she said that.

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:07.190
Please go away!

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:12.190
The Sensei will not be seeing
anyone today! Please go away!

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:15.740
Hmm. I was prepared for this,
but still, what a pain.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:20.570
I wonder what Mama is thinking.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:23.540
It couldn't be the thing
I'm most worried about...

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:28.080
What would I do, if Mama was
planning to send me away someday?

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:31.590
Take Maro-chan over, okay?

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:35.550
I told you, the Sensei
won't be saying anything!

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:37.840
Hello, there.

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:40.510
S- Sensei, your hair!

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:41.850
She's wearing it normally!

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:43.850
She's planning to give us
some honest answers!

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:46.180
Sensei! Is what you wrote
in your essay the truth?

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:47.520
What were your reasons
for publishing this?

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:48.850
How is Sana-chan doing right now?

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:50.690
There has been some criticism
about Sana-chan being used

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:51.520
as the subject matter.

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:53.190
Did you think about
Sana-chan's feelings?

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:54.860
--Kurata-san!
--Kurata-san, your statement?

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:55.860
Kurata-san!

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:04.280
I thought about it for
many years before doing this.

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:07.870
Naturally, I imagined what
all of you were going to say.

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:11.120
To me, everything that you are
saying is clichéd, and sure enough,

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:15.210
it appears to be all that
you are capable of saying.

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:19.840
I wonder how many of you have read
my book all the way through to the end.

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:21.340
Would you raise your hands for me?

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:28.100
I see. So, if any of you still have any
more of your banality for me, speak up.

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.810
So, when you say you thought about it
for a long time, how many years was that?

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:36.150
Did Sana-chan give any kind of
consent to having this book published?

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:37.820
Unperturbed, I see.

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:39.700
I knew they wouldn't be.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:45.280
Bye!

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:48.160
Mama, you rascal...!

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:49.870
Rats, she caught us off-guard.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:53.210
"You must not point fireworks at others."

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.500
You good boys and girls,

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.840
don't play around with fireworks
by pointing them at others.

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:57.130
That goes for you not-so-good
boys and girls, too.

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:00.170
Sensei...

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:04.180
I feel the same way as those people.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:09.180
--Do you really know how Sana-chan feels?
--Rei-kun, stop, okay? Okay?

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:11.850
--I told you, I did this,
knowing how she felt.
--Mama...

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:16.190
--I just can't believe that you do!
Sana-chan is still in elementary school!
--Rei-kun! Hold on! Rei-kun!

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:18.860
Even though she does work as a
TV personality, she is still a child!

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.860
--I know that. You don't have to tell me.
--Mama, you, too...

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:24.870
--I could understand if you only told
Sana-chan the truth, but you can't do this!
--Rei-kun, stop it!

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:27.200
--How much distress has Sana-chan
suffered up through today!?
--Mama, you stop it, too!

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:29.200
I told you, I knew when I did it.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.830
--If you knew, then there's no way
you could have done it!
--Rei-kun, enough...

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:34.170
--Something so cruel-- you're cold!
--Enough, Rei-kun...

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:37.170
You be quiet! A stranger like you
has no place butting in here!

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:39.380
You're a fine one to be
talking about strangers!

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:51.100
I can't stand it anymore!

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:57.610
What is that kid doing!?

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:05.240
Hayama-kun... we're kind of
in the middle of a fight here...

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:09.700
Hayama...

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:14.210
Hey, Hayama...!

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:16.040
J- just a minute, Hayama-kun!

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:18.960
--Ah, he's coming out!
--He's charging through again!

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:23.220
Huh? That's Sana-chan on the back!

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:26.220
See here! You mustn't ride
two on a bicycle! I mean it.

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:28.220
After them!

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:29.220
What's that car doing!?

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:32.310
Hayama-kun, for today,
I'll let you take care of her.

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:35.560
But someday, I will
definitely have Sana-chan...

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:38.360
Oh, I'm surprised you can say that.

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:45.570
That was fun! Like a
jet coaster in the dark!

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.660
Glad you liked it.

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:49.240
I saw the book.

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:51.910
Oh, yeah? How was it?

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:52.910
I was surprised.

00:21:52.910 --> 00:21:55.250
I'll bet, I'll bet! Take that!

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:56.960
What's with you?

00:22:40.710 --> 00:22:42.210
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:47.720
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:48.970 --> 00:22:52.470
In dire straits,

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:56.060
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.560 --> 00:22:59.940
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.900 --> 00:23:05.030
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.230 --> 00:23:11.070
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:13.280
...panic!!

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:19.120
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:21.830
he's there.

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.090
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:27.670
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:30.180
...for two.

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:33.640
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:38.390
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.310 --> 00:23:41.980
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.190 --> 00:23:46.690
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.610 --> 00:23:52.280
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:54.950
he's there,

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.120
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:03.210
...for two.

00:24:07.960 --> 00:24:10.670
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:13.550
I'm famished!
Hungry, hungry, hungry-gry!

00:24:13.550 --> 00:24:16.010
Is there anything I can eat?
Let's check the fridge...

00:24:16.010 --> 00:24:18.310
Oh, there's nothing decent in here.

00:24:18.310 --> 00:24:20.350
Oh, whoops, this is Hayama's house,
isn't it?

00:24:20.350 --> 00:24:22.980
Well, when people are worried,
they tend to get hungry, huh?

00:24:22.980 --> 00:24:23.980
It proves they're alive!

00:24:23.980 --> 00:24:28.320
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha, Episode 18 of
the "Relationships of Fate and Ramen" saga,

00:24:28.320 --> 00:24:32.320
A Hungry Pair Plays Hide-and-Seek

00:24:32.320 --> 00:24:35.410
This anime is getting
harder and harder to follow.
